# Git worktrees live under `.claude/` and carry a full copy of the tree, so the
# ignore patterns above — which are anchored at the repo root — stopped
# applying to them: `packages/ui/src/generated/` is ignored, but
# `.claude/worktrees/x/packages/ui/src/generated/` was not, and a single open
# worktree failed `format:check` (and therefore `pnpm verify`) on generated
# files nobody had touched. It also made a root `pnpm format` reach into
# another session's worktree and reformat them there.
